WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:01.806
Shelfmark keeps every link you save in one place.

2
00:00:01.806 --> 00:00:08.223
Open the demo: no account needed.

3
00:00:08.223 --> 00:00:15.726
Paste a link: the preview fills in by itself.

4
00:00:15.726 --> 00:00:23.635
Pick a folder and a tag, then save.

5
00:00:23.635 --> 00:00:33.999
A pile of links? Paste them all at once.

6
00:00:33.999 --> 00:00:41.984
Folders get a colour and an icon…

7
00:00:41.984 --> 00:00:46.751
…and the ones you use most stay pinned on top.

8
00:00:46.751 --> 00:00:52.001
A tag gathers its links from every folder.

9
00:00:52.001 --> 00:00:56.387
Need it again? Press ⌘K and type.

10
00:00:56.387 --> 00:01:01.731
Saved views keep the filters you use often.

11
00:01:01.731 --> 00:01:06.119
Star the keepers; Favorites gathers them.

12
00:01:06.119 --> 00:01:09.247
Recently opened brings back what you read.

13
00:01:09.247 --> 00:01:19.000
Deleted by mistake? Trash keeps it for 30 days.

14
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:32.552
Select several links and act on all of them at once.

15
00:01:32.552 --> 00:01:39.001
Or drag a card straight onto a folder.

16
00:01:39.001 --> 00:01:48.530
Light, dark, or your own accent colour.

17
00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:53.177
In six languages.

18
00:01:53.177 --> 00:01:56.470
Export everything, any time.

19
00:01:56.470 --> 00:02:06.481
And tell us what you think: we read every message.

20
00:02:06.481 --> 00:02:09.482
Shelfmark. Every link, back within reach.
